    "html": "<div style=\"width: 816px; height: 1056px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex; flex-direction: column\">\n<div style=\"padding: 40px 56px 24px; display: flex; justify-content: center\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-long.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 600px; height: 150px; object-fit: contain\">\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; padding: 40px 56px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">Grand opening · {{OPEN_HOUSE_DATE}}</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 50px; line-height: 1.05\">Now open in {{CITY}}: a new option for joint pain</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 20px; line-height: 1.45; color: #D9E1F2\">Knee, shoulder or hip still hurting after pills, shots or therapy? Meet the vascular specialists who evaluate patients for minimally invasive, image-guided joint procedures.</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 36px 56px; display: flex; gap: 32px; flex: 1\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 14px\">\n<h2 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #16306E\">Open house</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45\">{{OPEN_HOUSE_DATE}}, {{OPEN_HOUSE_TIME}}<br>Free joint pain screenings, meet the doctors, light refreshments.</p>\n<h2 style=\"margin: 8px 0 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-size: 24px; color: #16306E\">We treat pain in the</h2>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.6\">Knee · Hip · Shoulder · Hand<br>Wrist · Ankle · Lower back · Heel</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"flex: 1; background: #F7F6F2; border-radius: 12px; padding: 28px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 12px; justify-content: center\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 22px; color: #C8231E\">Reserve your screening</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px; color: #16306E\">661-324-4100</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 17px\">heartandleg.com</p>\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 14px; border-top: 1px solid #E2DED4; padding-top: 14px\">\n<img src=\"assets/qr-testimonial.png\" alt=\"QR code linking to a patient testimonial video\" style=\"width: 104px; height: 104px; flex: none; display: block\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Scan to watch</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 16px; line-height: 1.25; color: #16306E\">Hear a patient's story</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 12px; color: #4A5568\">Runtime 6:30 · Results vary</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"padding: 18px 56px 28px; border-top: 1px solid #E2DED4; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.45; color: #4A5568\">{{STREET}}, {{CITY_STATE_ZIP}} · A division of Heart Vascular &amp; Leg Center · Individual results vary; not everyone is a candidate. We verify insurance before your visit.</div>\n</div>"
