    "html": "<div style=\"width: 864px; height: 576px; box-sizing: border-box; background: #16306E; color: #FFFEFB; font-family: 'Public Sans', sans-serif; display: flex\">\n<div style=\"flex: 1; padding: 44px 40px 36px 48px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; letter-spacing: 3px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #F2A7A3\">New in {{CITY}}</p>\n<h1 style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 44px; line-height: 1.05\">Your joint pain deserves a second look.</h1>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 18px; line-height: 1.45; color: #D9E1F2\">Knee, shoulder or hip pain? Our vascular specialists evaluate whether a minimally invasive, outpatient procedure could be an option for you.</p>\n<div style=\"flex: 1\"></div>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 15px; color: #D9E1F2\">Free joint pain talk: {{TALK_DATE}} at {{TALK_VENUE}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 30px\">Call 661-324-4100</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"width: 300px; background: #FFFEFB; color: #1B2440; padding: 32px 28px; box-sizing: border-box; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 16px; justify-content: space-between\">\n<img src=\"assets/logo-tall.png\" alt=\"Advanced Joint Pain &amp; Vascular Center logo\" style=\"width: 244px; height: 180px; object-fit: contain\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 12px\">\n<img src=\"assets/qr-testimonial.png\" alt=\"QR code linking to a patient testimonial video\" style=\"width: 88px; height: 88px; flex: none; display: block\">\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 3px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 800; font-size: 11px; letter-spacing: 2px; text-transform: uppercase; color: #C8231E\">Scan to watch</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-family: 'Montserrat', sans-serif; font-weight: 700; font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.25; color: #16306E\">A patient's story</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 11px; color: #4A5568\">Runtime 6:30</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n<div style=\"display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px\">\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-weight: 600; font-size: 16px; color: #16306E\">{{STREET}}<br>{{CITY_STATE_ZIP}}</p>\n<p style=\"margin: 0; font-size: 13px; line-height: 1.4; color: #4A5568\">Results vary; not everyone is a candidate. Insurance verified before your visit.</p>\n</div>\n</div>\n</div>"
